        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F60BOW, Ornate Bowman Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage's ornate Bowman handleset features old world detailing on both pieces of the handleset. From the urn tip atop the deadbolt to the fanciful rings on the handle's mounts, this oval-shaped single cylinder handleset is steeped in traditional beauty. It is available in bright brass, lifetime bright brass, and antique brass finishes and will fit standard door preparations. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/bowman-dummy-handleset-schlage-f93bow\"><b>Bowman Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Bowman Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Bowman Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Outside Handle Length: 11-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Length: 4-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Length: 5-1/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Width: 2-9/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 2-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center deadbolt to latch spacing</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bowman Single Cylinder Handleset, Schlage F60BOW",
                "description": "Bowman Single Cylinder Handleset Schlage F-BOW - Schlage's ornate Bowman handleset features old world detailing on both pieces of the handleset. From the urn tip atop the deadbolt to the fanciful rings on the handle's mounts, this oval-shaped single cylinder handleset is steeped in traditional beauty. It is available in bright brass, lifetime bright brass, and antique brass finishes and will fit standard door preparations. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior.",
                "keywords": "SCH-f60BOW, Schlage Bowman handlesets, Schlage f60BOW, schlage single cylinder handlesets, grade 1 handlesets, oval handlesets, traditional front door handlesets, traditional handlesets, schlage f series single cylinder handlesets,"
